                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">“Southampton,</hi> 14<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >th.</hi>—Intelligence has arrived here that an engagement took place yesterday
                    near Jersey between the federal corvette Kearsarge and the confederate steamer
                    Florida. The Kearsarge, being much injured, was obliged to take refuge in a
                    neighboring port. The Florida remains outside, ready to renew the
                    engagement.”</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">“Suez,</hi> 14<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >th</hi>.—According to accounts from Bombay to the 24th ultimo, the Emir of
                    Caboul has defeated Afza-Khan in a grand battle fought near Bavncea.”</p>
            </div>
